    4306   00:56D4  E5                      push    hl                      ; we might need it later
    4307   00:56D5                      ; Grauw Optimized 16 bit loop, handy for us, mostly since we can use outi :-D
    4308   00:56D5  43                      ld  b,e                         ; Number of loops originaly in DE
    4309   00:56D6  1B                      dec de
